.TH MAINUAN-INSTALL-APPIMAGE 1 "October 2026" "2.0.0"
.SH NAME
mainuan-install-appimage \- inspect and install AppImages on Mainuan
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B mainuan-install-appimage
.RI [ file.AppImage ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Opens a Qt Widgets installer in Brazilian Portuguese. Without a file,
it opens a file chooser. Supports little-endian ELF AppImage Type 2
with SquashFS 4.0. Inspection never executes the supplied application.
Installation requires administrator authentication through PolicyKit.
.SH SECURITY
The graphical interface must run as an ordinary user. A restricted helper
validates a private snapshot and builds a Debian package without maintainer
scripts. Applications only run after an explicit click.
.SH LIMITATIONS
Type 1 is unsupported. A failed dpkg transaction may require manual recovery.
.SH AUTHORS
Mainuan. Based on the installer by Natanael Barbosa Santos (MIT).
